  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 103.07 Office Location, Mailing Address, and Telephone.\n\n(a) The board's location, mailing address, and telephone number are:\n\nBoard of Family Mediator Certification\n\nc/o Office of Professional Licensure and Certification\n\n7 Eagle Square\n\nConcord NH, 03301\n\n603-271-2152\n\nSource. #7916, eff 7-11-03; ss by #9667, eff 4-2-10; ss by #14430 (formerly Fam 103.05), eff 11-22-25",
